Root cause:
The bug was caused by the tuner links not being properly disabled before enabling the source in the `au0828_enable_source()` function. This oversight led to issues when the tuner was requested by video or audio, as the links between the tuner and decoder/demodulator were still active, causing potential conflicts and incorrect behavior. The patch addresses this by ensuring that the tuner and decoder are cached and that their links are disabled appropriately during the media device registration process.
